msgid "Running Molpro"
msgstr "运行 Molpro"

msgid ""
"On Unix systems, Molpro is accessed using the *molpro* unix command. The "
"syntax is"
msgstr "在 Unix 系统上，Molpro 通过 *molpro* Unix 命令访问。语法为"

msgid "For example, a serial Molpro calculation is started using"
msgstr "例如，一个串行 Molpro 计算通过以下方式启动"

msgid "``molpro mymolecule.inp``"
msgstr "``molpro mymolecule.inp``"

msgid ""
"and this creates an output ``mymolecule.out``. For larger calculations, it "
"may be necessary to specify how much dynamic (stack) memory molpro can "
"allocate, using the ``-m`` option:"
msgstr ""
"这将创建一个输出文件 ``mymolecule.out``\\ 。对于较大的计算，可能需要使用 ``-m`` 选项指定 Molpro "
"可以分配多少动态（堆栈）内存："

msgid "``molpro -m100 mymolecule.inp``"
msgstr "``molpro -m100 mymolecule.inp``"

msgid "General Options"
msgstr "通用选项"

msgid ""
"``--directory-backup`` Backup files are stored in a single separate "
"subdirectory, named *datafile*\\ ``.d``, with subdirectories ``01``, ``02``,"
" :math:`\\dots`. ``--directory-backup`` and ``--append-backup`` are mutually"
" exclusive, and switching one of them on will force the other to be switched"
" off. ``--no-append-backup`` ``--no-directory-backup`` can also be specified"
" with the same effect, except that they do not also imply ``--backup``."
msgstr ""
"``--directory-backup`` 备份文件存储在单个独立的子目录中，名为 *datafile*\\ ``.d``\\ ，包含子目录 "
"``01``\\ 、\\ ``02``\\ 、\\ :math:`\\dots`\\ 。\\ ``--directory-backup`` 和 "
"``--append-backup`` 是互斥的，开启其中一个将强制关闭另一个。也可以指定 ``--no-append-backup`` ``--no-"
"directory-backup`` 以达到相同的效果，只是它们不隐含 ``--backup``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``--xml-orbdump`` If this option, which is the default, is given, more data "
"such as the basis set and the occupied orbitals are dumped to the XML file, "
"ready for interpretation by iMolpro or gmolpro. Orbitals are written "
"whenever they are created, except in a geometry optimisation or finite-"
"displacement frequency calculation. For jobs that create many orbital sets, "
"to avoid creating large files, the writing of orbitals can be switched off "
"with ``-no-xml-orbdump``, or by setting the variable ``NO_XML_ORBDUMP`` in "
"the input file."
msgstr ""
"``--xml-orbdump`` "
"如果给出此选项（默认启用），更多数据（如基组和占据轨道）将被转储到XML文件中，以便iMolpro或gmolpro进行解析。轨道在创建时即被写入，但在几何优化或有限位移频率计算中除外。对于生成多个轨道集的任务，为避免生成大文件，可通过\\"
" ``-no-xml-orbdump``\\ 选项或在输入文件中设置变量\\ ``NO_XML_ORBDUMP``\\ 来关闭轨道写入功能。"

msgid ""
"``--stdout`` Write the plain-text output to standard output instead of the "
"``.out`` file. The ``.xml`` file is unaffected. This option can be useful "
"when using an integrated development environment."
msgstr ""
"``--stdout`` 将纯文本输出写入标准输出，而非 ``.out`` 文件。\\ ``.xml`` "
"文件不受影响。在使用集成开发环境时，此选项可能有用。"

msgid ""
"``--geometry`` Use this to obtain an XML output with geometry information, "
"but without performing any electronic structure calculation (e.g. to "
"visualise the geometry). Note that it needs at least one jobstep, e.g. “hf” "
"though this jobstep will not be executed."
msgstr ""
"``--geometry`` "
"使用此选项可获取包含几何结构信息的XML输出，但不执行任何电子结构计算（例如，用于可视化几何结构）。请注意，它至少需要一个作业步骤，例如“hf”，尽管此作业步骤不会被执行。"

msgid ""
"``--no-flush6`` Don’t flush the output, this might increase performance on "
"some systems as the expense of being able to poll the output."
msgstr "``--no-flush6`` 不刷新输出，这可能会在某些系统上提高性能，但代价是无法轮询输出。"

msgid "``--nouse-logfile`` All output will be in the regular output file."
msgstr "``--nouse-logfile`` 所有输出将位于常规输出文件中。"

msgid "``--version`` Print Molpro version and exit"
msgstr "``--version`` 打印 Molpro 版本并退出"

msgid ""
"``--database`` Instead of executing Molpro, instead run one of the database "
"utility scripts as described in section `interrogation and manipulation of "
"databases <post-processing_of_output_and_databases.html#interrogation-and-"
"manipulation-of-databases>`__."
msgstr ""
"``--database`` 不执行 Molpro，而是运行数据库实用脚本，如章节 `interrogation and manipulation of"
" databases <post-processing_of_output_and_databases.html#interrogation-and-"
"manipulation-of-databases>`__ 所述。"

msgid ""
"``--sysid`` For debugging when the getinfo.sh script does not give the "
"correct sysid."
msgstr "``--sysid`` 用于调试，当 getinfo.sh 脚本未能提供正确的系统标识时。"

msgid "Options for launching Molpro"
msgstr "启动 Molpro 的选项"

msgid ""
"These options are for the ``molpro`` shell script which is used to launch "
"the ``molpro.exe`` MPI program. These options should be given on the command"
" line or in the ``MOLPRO_OPTIONS`` environment variable as both of these are"
" parsed by the shell script and used to launch ``molpro.exe``, they should "
"not be given in ``.molprorc`` or any other configuration files since these "
"are not read until after ``molpro.exe`` is launched."
msgstr ""
"这些选项用于启动 ``molpro.exe`` MPI 程序的 ``molpro`` shell 脚本。这些选项应在命令行中或在 "
"``MOLPRO_OPTIONS`` 环境变量中指定，因为这两者都由 shell 脚本解析并用于启动 ``molpro.exe``\\ ，它们不应在 "
"``.molprorc`` 或任何其他配置文件中指定，因为这些文件在 ``molpro.exe`` 启动后才会被读取。"

msgid "Options for parallel execution"
msgstr "并行执行选项"

msgid ""
"The options specific to parallel execution are described `here "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#specifying-parallel-"
"execution>`__."
msgstr ""
"特定于并行执行的选项在 `此处 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#specifyingparallelexecution>`__ "
"描述。"

msgid "``molpro options datafile``"
msgstr "``molpro options datafile``"

msgid ""
"Molpro’s execution is controlled by user-prepared data; if *datafile* is not"
" given on the command line, the data is read from standard input, and "
"program results go to standard output. Otherwise, data is taken from "
"*datafile,* and the output is written to a file whose name is generated from"
" *datafile* by removing any trailing suffix, and appending ``.out``. The "
"name *datafile* must not contain parenthesis, brackets, or other special "
"characters like exclamation marks (!), question marks (?), slashes (/), "
"backslashes (\\), blanks( ), equality signs(:math:`=`), commas (,), "
"semicolons (;), asterisks (\\*), or any kind of quotes. If the output file "
"already exists, then the old file is appended to the same name with suffix "
"``.out_1``, and then deleted. This provides a mechanism for saving old "
"output files from overwriting. Note that the above behaviour can be modified"
" with the ``-o`` or ``-s`` options."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 的执行由用户准备的数据控制；如果命令行中未给出 *datafile*\\ ，则从标准输入读取数据，程序结果输出到标准输出。否则，数据取自 "
"*datafile，* 输出写入一个文件，其名称由 *datafile* 去除任何尾部后缀并追加 ``.out`` 生成。名称 *datafile* "
"不得包含括号、方括号或其他特殊字符，如感叹号（!）、问号（?）、斜杠（/）、反斜杠（\\\\）、空格（ ）、等号（\\ :math:`=`\\ "
"）、逗号（,）、分号（;）、星号（\\\\*）或任何类型的引号。如果输出文件已存在，则旧文件被追加同名但后缀为 ``.out_1`` "
"的文件，然后被删除。这提供了一种保存旧输出文件免遭覆盖的机制。请注意，上述行为可通过 ``-o`` 或 ``-s`` 选项修改。"

msgid ""
"This allocates 100 MW (megawords) of stack memory. Further options are "
"necessary for parallel execution, see section `specifying parallel execution"
" <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#specifying-parallel-"
"execution>`__. For parallel executions, it is very important to read and "
"understand also sections `GA Installation notes "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#ga-installation-notes>`__ and "
"`memory specifications <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-"
"specifications>`__."
msgstr ""
"这将分配 100 MW（兆字）的栈内存。并行执行需要更多选项，参见 `specifying parallel execution "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#specifying-parallel-execution>`__"
" 一节。对于并行执行，阅读并理解 `GA Installation notes "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#ga-installation-notes>`__ 和 "
"`memory specifications <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-"
"specifications>`__ 两节非常重要。"

msgid ""
"Most options are not required, since sensible system defaults are usually "
"set. Options as detailed below may be given, in order of decreasing "
"priority, on the command line, in the environment variable MOLPRO_OPTIONS, "
"or in the files ``./molpro.rc`` and ``$HOME/.molprorc``."
msgstr ""
"大多数选项并不需要，因为通常已设置了合理的系统默认值。如下详述的选项可按优先级递减的顺序在命令行、环境变量 MOLPRO_OPTIONS 或文件 "
"``./molpro.rc`` 和 ``$HOME/.molprorc`` 中给出。"

msgid ""
"**``-o`` :math:`|` ``--output`` *outfile*** [option:o] specifies a different"
" output file."
msgstr "**``-o`` :math:`|` ``--output`` *\\ outfile*** [option:o] 指定不同的输出文件。"

msgid ""
"**``-d`` :math:`|` ``--directory`` *directory*** specifies the scratch "
"directory for the program."
msgstr "**``-d`` :math:`|` ``--directory`` *\\ directory*** 指定程序的临时目录。"

msgid ""
"**``--backup`` *nfile*** enables the saving of previous output files, up to "
"a maximum of  *nfile*. If *nfile* is omitted, it defaults to infinity. The "
"names of the backup files are constructed by appending ``_`` and a sequence "
"number to the output file name, and both regular and xml-format files are "
"processed, together with any log file."
msgstr ""
"**``--backup`` *\\ nfile*** 启用对先前输出文件的保存，最多保存 *\\ nfile\\ * 个。如果省略 *\\ "
"nfile*，则默认为无限。备份文件的名称通过在输出文件名后追加 ``_`` 和一个序号构成，常规文件和 xml 格式文件以及任何日志文件都将被处理。"

msgid ""
"**``-a`` :math:`|` ``--append-backup``** Previous output files are "
"concatenated by appending, instead of being kept separate."
msgstr "**``-a`` :math:`|` ``--append-backup``** 先前的输出文件通过追加方式连接，而不是分开保存。"

msgid ""
"**``--backup-directory`` *dir*** In the case of ``--directory-backup``, use "
"//// dir as the location of backup files instead of the default."
msgstr ""
"**``--backup-directory`` *\\ dir*** 在 ``--directory-backup`` 情况下，使用 //// dir"
" 作为备份文件的位置，而不是默认位置。"

msgid ""
"**``-s`` :math:`|` ``--nobackup``** disables the mechanism whereby an "
"existing output file is saved."
msgstr "**``-s`` :math:`|` ``--nobackup``** 禁用保存现有输出文件的机制。"

msgid ""
"**``-v`` :math:`|` ``--verbose``** causes the procedure to echo debugging "
"information; ``--noverbose`` selects quiet operation (default)."
msgstr ""
"**``-v`` :math:`|` ``--verbose``** 使该过程回显调试信息；\\ ``--noverbose`` 选择安静运行（默认）。"

msgid ""
"``-k //key//`` where *key* is the licence key. This is normally not "
"necessary since the key should be installed globally when installing Molpro."
msgstr "``-k //key//`` 其中 *key* 是许可证密钥。通常不需要，因为在安装 Molpro 时密钥应已全局安装。"

msgid ""
"**``-m`` :math:`|` ``--memory`` *memory* (in megawords)** specifies the "
"working (stack) memory to be assigned to the program, in 8-byte words. For "
"details, see section `memory allocation "
"<general_program_structure.html#memory-allocation>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``-m`` :math:`|` ``--memory`` *\\ memory\\ *（以兆字为单位）** 指定分配给程序的工作（栈）内存，以 8"
" 字节字为单位。详情参见 `memory allocation <general_program_structure.html#memory-"
"allocation>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``-M`` :math:`|` ``--memory-per-node`` *M*** total memory per node (stack "
"+ GA, in megawords) For details, see section `memory allocation "
"<general_program_structure.html#memory-allocation>`__"
msgstr ""
"**``-M`` :math:`|` ``--memory-per-node`` *\\ M*** 每个节点的总内存（栈 + "
"GA，以兆字为单位）详情参见 `memory allocation <general_program_structure.html#memory-"
"allocation>`__ 一节"

msgid ""
"**``-I`` :math:`|` ``--main-file-repository`` *directory*** specifies the "
"directory where the permanent copy of any integral file (file 1) resides. "
"This may be a pathname which is absolute or relative to the current "
"directory (e.g., ’\\ ``.``\\ ’ would specify the current directory). "
"Normally, the ``-I`` directory should be equal to the ``-d`` working "
"directory to avoid copying of large integral files, since after completion "
"of the job the file will be copied to the directory given after ``-I``. On "
"some main frames, the scratch directory is erased automatically after a job "
"has terminated, and in such cases a different ``-I`` directory, e.g., "
"``$HOME/int``, can be specified (environment variables will be expanded at "
"run time). In view of the large integral file sizes, this should be used "
"with care, however. Note that in parallel runs with more than 1 processor "
"the integral file will never be copied, and cannot be restarted."
msgstr ""
"**``-I`` :math:`|` ``--main-file-repository`` *\\ directory*** 指定任何积分文件（文件 "
"1）的永久副本所在目录。这可以是绝对路径名，也可以是相对于当前目录的路径名（例如，’\\\\ ``.``\\\\ ’ 将指定当前目录）。通常，\\ "
"``-I`` 目录应等于 ``-d`` 工作目录，以避免复制大型积分文件，因为作业完成后该文件将被复制到 ``-I`` "
"之后给出的目录。在某些大型机上，临时目录在作业终止后会自动清除，此时可指定不同的 ``-I`` 目录，例如 ``$HOME/int``\\ "
"（环境变量将在运行时展开）。然而，鉴于积分文件体积庞大，应谨慎使用。请注意，在超过 1 个处理器的并行运行中，积分文件永远不会被复制，且无法重启。"

msgid ""
"**``-W`` :math:`|` ``--wavefunction-file-repository`` *directory*** is "
"similar to ``--main-file-repository`` except that it refers to the directory"
" for the wavefunction files (2,3 and 4). This determines the destination of "
"permanent wavefunction (dump) files used for storing information like "
"orbitals or CI-vectors etc. These files are essential for restarting a job. "
"As explained for the integral files above, permanent wavefunction files will"
" be copied to *directory* after completion of the job. The default for "
"*directory* is ``$HOME/wfu``."
msgstr ""
"**``-W`` :math:`|` ``--wavefunction-file-repository`` *\\ directory*** 与 "
"``--main-file-repository`` 类似，只是它指的是波函数文件（2、3 和 4）的目录。这决定了用于存储轨道或 CI "
"向量等信息的永久波函数（转储）文件的目标位置。这些文件对于重启作业至关重要。如上面对积分文件的解释，永久波函数文件将在作业完成后复制到 *\\ "
"directory\\ *。*\\ directory* 的默认值为 ``$HOME/wfu``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``-X`` :math:`|` ``--xml-output``** specifies that an additional XML "
"output file suitable for automatic post-processing will be written, with "
"suffix .xml. Important data such as input, geometries, and results are "
"stored in a `marked-up format <https://www.molpro.net/schema/molpro-"
"output.xsd>`__. ``--no-xml-output`` switches off this behaviour."
msgstr ""
"**``-X`` :math:`|` ``--xml-output``** 指定将写入一个适合自动后处理的附加 XML 输出文件，后缀为 "
".xml。输入、几何结构和结果等重要数据以 `marked-up format "
"<https://www.molpro.net/schema/molpro-output.xsd>`__ 存储。\\ ``--no-xml-"
"output`` 关闭此行为。"

msgid ""
"**``-L`` :math:`|` ``--library`` *directory*** specifies the directory where"
" the basis set library files (``LIBMOL*``) are found."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``-g`` :math:`|` ``--use-logfile``** Use a separate logfile for more in-"
"depth output."
msgstr "**``-g`` :math:`|` ``--use-logfile``** 使用单独的日志文件以获得更深入的输出。"

msgid ""
"**``-E`` :math:`|` ``--exclusive-file-implementation``** Specify file "
"implementation. This is mainly for debugging, eg. reproducing non-shared "
"file problems on a system with shared files, normally the default should be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"**``-E`` :math:`|` ``--exclusive-file-implementation``** "
"指定文件实现方式。这主要用于调试，例如在具有共享文件的系统上重现非共享文件问题，通常应使用默认值。"

msgid ""
"**``--name`` *name=string*** Set string variable on the command line, eg. "
"``--name`` basis=vtz."
msgstr "**``--name`` *\\ name=string*** 在命令行上设置字符串变量，例如 ``--name`` basis=vtz。"

msgid ""
"**``-V`` :math:`|` ``--var`` *name=value*** Set variable on the command "
"line, eg. ``--var`` len=1.2."
msgstr ""
"**``-V`` :math:`|` ``--var`` *\\ name=value*** 在命令行上设置变量，例如 ``--var`` "
"len=1.2。"

msgid ""
"**``-k`` :math:`|` ``--licence-token``** Specify licence token on the "
"command line."
msgstr "**``-k`` :math:`|` ``--licence-token``** 在命令行上指定许可证令牌。"

msgid ""
"**``-n`` :math:`|` ``--tasks`` *tasks*** specifies the number of parallel "
"processes to be set up."
msgstr "**``-n`` :math:`|` ``--tasks`` *\\ tasks*** 指定要设置的并行进程数。"

msgid ""
"**``-N`` :math:`|` ``--task-specification`` "
"*node1:tasks1,node2:tasks2:math:`\\dots`*** *node1, node2* etc. specify the "
"host names of the nodes on which to run."
msgstr ""
"**``-N`` :math:`|` ``--task-specification`` *\\ node1:tasks1,node2:tasks2\\ "
":math:`\\dots`*** *\\ node1, node2* 等指定运行所在节点的主机名。"

msgid ""
"It is very important to read :doc:`running Molpro on parallel computers "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers>` before executing parallel Molpro "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"在执行并行 Molpro 计算之前，阅读 :doc:`running Molpro on parallel computers "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers>` 非常重要。"
